$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag\n<f1>Planet: <f0> h0micidal\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Indoors\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Night\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> Your neighbor is knocking on your door, and it's a safe bet he isn't here to bring you brownies... 2 heavily fortified teams, each within a few yards of each other. Its kill or be killed. Capture the center objective for more ammo and inventory stations in very opportune locations. Capture the enemy flag by grabbing it and bringing it back to yours. The first team with 40 flag caps and/or objectives will be the winner."@
	 "\n<f1>Map built by: <f0>[CoD]h0micide http://www.codx.com";
